cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: llama-annotation-pipeline
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Snakemake workflow for the structural annotation of a
  chromosome-level Lama glama genome assembly by homology transfer and ab initio
  prediction, with evaluation against an external reference. Generates four
  proteome sets and a combined candidate reference proteome of 20,708 sequences,
  stratified into three nested confidence layers.
